      "content": "wait, benadryl for my breathing? that sounds a bit weird. i'm also noticing the pain in my leg is getting kind of sharp, like a stabbing sensation, and it's actually getting harder to breathe if i try to walk to the kitchen or even just stand up. u sure it's just air pressure? i was thinking maybe i should check in with a doctor just in case, but i really don't want to deal with an ER visit right now if it's nothing.",
